<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS3" title="In Appendix B More Experimental Results ‣ Cross-Layer Vision Smoothing: Enhancing Visual Understanding via Sustained Focus on Key Objects in Large Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.3 </span><math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma~" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma~</annotation></semantics></math> for LLaVA-Next and Qwen2.5-VL</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
